# Agent workflow governance

Non-trivial change: PRD APPROVED → PLAN APPROVED → IMPLEMENT → review-staged → COMMIT.

Never implement directly from PRD-DRAFT. One capability has one production owner. REPLACE requires REMOVE unless a bounded compatibility contract has a current consumer and removal condition. Historical buggy behavior belongs under tests/fixtures, never production.
